# Compatibility shim for scanners that auto-load only the plain file.
# Rationale, package scope and expiry are in .trivyignore.yaml.
# Adopted from approved upstream master policy e7197aa2/40cb0cba; image-size is fixed.
#
# node-forge: no patched release exists (advisory covers <= 1.4.0, the latest).
# Reached only through dev tooling — @expo/cli (dev-server code signing) and
# dev-server manifest signing — never shipped in an app bundle. Re-evaluate by 2026-12-31.
CVE-2026-85393 exp:2026-12-31
#
# braces: no patched release exists (advisory covers <= 3.0.3, the latest).
# Reached only through build/dev tooling — micromatch and chokidar under metro,
# jest, fast-glob, tailwindcss and webpack-dev-server — which expand glob
# patterns from our own config, never untrusted input, and never ship in an app
# bundle. Re-evaluate by 2026-11-11.
CVE-2026-93687 exp:2026-11-11
